        "note": "The 241-row expected output: running-exhaust Total Energy Consumption for 125 (modelYearID, fuelTypeID) cohorts at 2020 and 116 at 2015. The 2020 block equals `expand-day`'s weekday block at every cell. DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING -- reading it would transcribe the answer and its extent would transcribe the answer's shape. compare-output.py reads it directly under tolerance.toml.",
